{"analytics_identifier":null,"base_path":"/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-recall-sand-filled-weirdo-toys-sold-via-amazon-2607-0036","content_id":"e13564aa-7a62-4653-a71e-e359f75046b0","description":"Product Recall of Sand-Filled Weirdo Toys presenting a risk to health.","details":{"attachments":[{"attachment_type":"file","content_id":"1599b619-f901-4f41-ade0-df25aab18aca","content_type":"application/pdf","created_at":"2026-07-06T13:29:25+01:00","id":"1599b619-f901-4f41-ade0-df25aab18aca","title":"Link to product image and PDF","updated_at":"2026-07-06T13:29:25+01:00","url":"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/6a4b9fa5e50f952c9b89e5e6/2607-0036-product-recall-sand-filled-weirdo.pdf"}],"body":"<h2 id=\"summary\">Summary</h2>\n\n<p>Product:  Sand-Filled Weirdo Toys sold via Amazon</p>\n\n<p>Hazard: The product presents a risk to health as the sand within the toy may be contaminated with a small quantity of asbestos.</p>\n\n<p>Corrective action: The product has been withdrawn from the market and recalled from end users by the seller, Nico Toys Limited.</p>\n\n<h2 id=\"product-information\">Product information</h2>\n\n<table>\n  <thead>\n    <tr>\n      <th scope=\"col\">Type</th>\n      <th scope=\"col\">Toys - Action Figures (Non-Powered)</th>\n    </tr>\n  </thead>\n  <tbody>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Manufacturer</td>\n      <td>Forever Shiny Limited</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Country of Origin</td>\n      <td>China</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Product Description</td>\n      <td>Sand-filled novelty action figure / squeezy toy.</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Product Report and Image</td>\n      <td><span id=\"attachment_1599b619-f901-4f41-ade0-df25aab18aca\" class=\"attachment-inline\"><a href=\"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/6a4b9fa5e50f952c9b89e5e6/2607-0036-product-recall-sand-filled-weirdo.pdf\">Link to product image and PDF</a></span></td>\n    </tr>\n  </tbody>\n</table>\n\n<h3 id=\"affected-models\">Affected Models</h3>\n\n<table>\n  <thead>\n    <tr>\n      <th scope=\"col\">Product Name</th>\n      <th scope=\"col\">Item Number</th>\n    </tr>\n  </thead>\n  <tbody>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Sand Filled Weirdo - Dog</td>\n      <td>F-SDWDOG-1P</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Sand Filled Weirdo - Frog</td>\n      <td>F-SDWFROG-1P</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Sand Filled Weirdo - Gorilla</td>\n      <td>F-SDWGORIL-1P</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Sand Filled Weirdo - Green Head Fish</td>\n      <td>F-SDWGRFISH-1P</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Sand Filled Weirdo - Pig</td>\n      <td>F-SDWPIG-1P</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Sand Filled Weirdo - Pineapple Duck</td>\n      <td>F-SDWPDUCK-1P</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Sand Filled Weirdo - Poopman</td>\n      <td>F-SDWPOOP-1P</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Sand Filled Weirdo - Rabbit</td>\n      <td>F-SDWRABB-1P</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Sand Filled Weirdo - Mule</td>\n      <td>F-SDWMULE-1P</td>\n    </tr>\n  </tbody>\n</table>\n\n<h2 id=\"hazard\">Hazard</h2>\n\n<p>The product presents a risk to health as the sand in the toy may be contaminated with a small quantity of asbestos. Asbestos is a banned substance because it poses a risk to health even at low levels of exposure.</p>\n\n<p>The product does not meet the requirements of the Toys (Safety) Regulations 2011.</p>\n\n<h2 id=\"corrective-action\">Corrective action</h2>\n\n<p>The products have been withdrawn from the market and recalled from end users by the seller, Nico Toys Limited.</p>\n\n<p>We recommend owners stop using the product immediately. Follow the below instructions for details on disposal or return of the product.</p>\n\n<h3 id=\"disposal-instructions\">Disposal instructions:</h3>\n\n<ul>\n  <li>If the product is intact and the sand is not accessible, place in a heavy-duty plastic bag, double tape it securely, label it clearly and store in a secure location out of the reach of children.</li>\n  <li>If the product is damaged and the sand is accessible, clean up sites where the product was used using wet cloths to avoid generating dust. Wear gloves and a mask. Double bag the sand, gloves, mask and cloths.</li>\n  <li>Keep children and other people away from areas where the sand has been used until the area has been cleaned.</li>\n  <li>Follow the instructions provided by Nico Toys Limited on return of affected products, or contact your local authority / access their website for guidance on safe disposal of asbestos in your area.</li>\n  <li>For further information, please contact Nico Toys Limited or visit the <a href=\"https://www.gov.uk/guidance/asbestos-in-consumer-products\">Government guidance page on asbestos in consumer products</a>\n</li>\n</ul>\n\n<h3 id=\"additional-information\">Additional information</h3>\n\n<p>PSD case number: 2607-0036</p>\n\n<p>Lead Authority: Office for Product Safety and Standards</p>\n","change_history":[{"note":"First published.","public_timestamp":"2026-07-06T12:31:47Z"}],"headers":[{"id":"summary","level":2,"text":"Summary"},{"headers":[{"id":"affected-models","level":3,"text":"Affected Models"}],"id":"product-information","level":2,"text":"Product information"},{"id":"hazard","level":2,"text":"Hazard"},{"headers":[{"id":"disposal-instructions","level":3,"text":"Disposal instructions:"},{"id":"additional-information","level":3,"text":"Additional information"}],"id":"corrective-action","level":2,"text":"Corrective action"}],"max_cache_time":10,"metadata":{"product_alert_type":"product-recall","product_category":"toys","product_measure_type":["recall-of-product-from-end-users","withdrawal-of-product-from-market"],"product_recall_alert_date":"2026-07-06","product_risk_level":"not-provided"},"temporary_update_type":false},"document_type":"product_safety_alert_report_recall","first_published_at":"2026-07-06T13:31:47+01:00","links":{"available_translations":[{"api_path":"/api/content/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/pr